{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">胡諾言與陳琪結婚17年，育有兩女一子，一家五口向來是圈中公認的模範家庭。日前，大女胡芷苓迎來17歲生日，全家人齊聚一堂為她溫馨慶祝。陳琪隨後在社交平台一連發布三個帖文，並上載多張慶生現場的照片，與大眾分享愛女成長的喜悅。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"a5e93b02-2088-43b4-be8e-c05f0fc67ac0.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026npmGO1K3tV1788772484.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"a5e93b02-2088-43b4-be8e-c05f0fc67ac0.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">從分享的照片可見，壽星女胡芷苓身穿米白色針織衫內搭白色吊帶，造型溫柔嫻靜，氣質十分出眾；而二女胡芷悠則以一身白色吊帶裙配搭披肩上陣，展現燦爛笑容。兩姊妹完美遺傳了父母的優良基因，不僅五官精緻，身形亦相當高挑。今次兩人更特別化上精緻的妝容，打扮得亭亭玉立，令人眼前一亮。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"5d6b0df3-4291-4449-9da8-8e6a994057fa.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026N6MNgm7WRI1788772484.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"5d6b0df3-4291-4449-9da8-8e6a994057fa.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"8bd46dd4-7ff3-4da1-98e0-673a3202b20c.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026bVmkPRo4kp1788772484.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"8bd46dd4-7ff3-4da1-98e0-673a3202b20c.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">兩個囡囡不僅擁有出眾外型，學業成績亦同樣優異。胡芷苓與妹妹胡芷悠、弟弟胡澔錕均就讀於星二代熱門名校保良局蔡繼有學校。當中，大女胡芷苓去年更在 IGCSE 考試中勇奪亮眼佳績，獲學校邀請出席頒獎典禮接受公開嘉許，絕對是才貌雙全！</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-07T09:38:55.159523+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":359,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}